  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-metalwork/assets/150550990/9b5a9711-dc60-4ca4-9ff3-250773771547\" alt=\"cmlogofixed2\"></p><h3><strong>關於本模組</strong></h3><p>Create: Metalwork 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的擴充模組，新增了多種流體與粉碎礦石，可提升每塊礦石所能獲得的錠數量。本模組能與其他添加熔融金屬及基於 Create 的錠處理模組無縫協作。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-metalwork/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配方範例</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>現有內容</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>全新的錠合成方式，產量比原版熔煉更高！</li>\n<li>新增多種礦石的熔融形態。</li>\n<li>新增多種粉碎礦石。</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>物品預覽 (1.0.10)</strong></h3><p>Fabric/Forge 雙版本：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/537fb716-6505-44e5-8353-ca12748c4dd3\" alt=\"metalworkprevfabric\"></p><p>僅限 Forge：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/979ca042-1442-4ac2-9a21-3b530fd9b598\" alt=\"metalworkprevforgeitems\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8ad233e-97b6-4878-82d7-f83779b14e1f\" alt=\"metalworkprevforgefluids\"></p><h3><strong>支援模組</strong></h3><p><em>註：1.0.10 版本中，Fabric 內容可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 在 Forge 上運行</em></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Creating Space</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Big Cannons</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-dreams-desires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Dreams &amp; Desires</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-ironworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Ironworks</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metallurgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Metallurgy</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-molten-metals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Molten Metals</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-northstar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Northstar</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-simple-ore-doubling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Simple Ore Doubling</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: The Factory Must Grow</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-revolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Revolution</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foreganized-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized Refabricated</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/liquid-burner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Liquid Burner</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>模組推薦：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/almost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost United</a> - 統一配方以減少物品重複性。</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>其他作品</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Engineers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>致謝</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>基礎程式碼源自 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tutorials-By-Kaupenjoe/Fabric-Tutorial-1.20.X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tutorials By Kaupenjoe</a>。</li>\n<li>流體程式碼源自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a>（作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/flomik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a>）。</li>\n<li>部分物品材質基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 中的資源。</li>\n<li>流體材質基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 中的資源。</li>\n</ul>",
